Quantum thread attention is actually picking up on its own right now.

Not because of some big catalyst or coordinated shill, but more ppl are just starting to dig into the actual projects building post-quantum stuff.

You’re seeing more real conversations around which chains are native vs which ones still need to migrate, and the pure-play ones are starting to get more eyes.

With this kind of slow burn momentum, I think the narrative still has room to run before it gets fully crowded.

So if you’re looking for projects actually building in the post-quantum space, I’ve got you covered here by tier:

✨ Tier S (already shipped)

@QRLedger | base:0x37696cd8f723ce541ac376f79fc109080e505ba3: Native XMSS since 2018. Every transaction is PQC from day one. Longest track record, no migration needed.

@NEARProtocol | $NEAR: ML-DSA signing live on mainnet since Jul 2026. Accounts can add a PQC key without changing address.

@QuantusNetwork | $QTC: ML-DSA from genesis, mainnet ~Sep 2026. Uses ZK aggregation to reduce signature bloat.

✨ Tier A (gaining traction)

@Starknet | $STRK: Already demoed Falcon/ML-DSA. Account abstraction makes switching signature schemes easier.

@PQabelian | abelian:native: Lattice-based native + privacy. Live mainnet for a while, supports multi-algorithm (Blanc Fork), has QDay L2 EVM-compatible.

@mochimocrypto | $MCM: Native hash-based (WOTS+) since 2018, same generation as QRL.

@Algorand | algorand:native: Falcon-1024 accounts live on mainnet (Aug 2026) + Falcon State Proofs since 2022

✨ Tier B (Building momentum, tooling/infra value)

@QANplatform | $QANX: Hybrid Dilithium + hash, EVM-compatible, dual-key.

@cellframenet | $CELL: Uses CRYSTALS-Dilithium, already live.

@SuiNetwork | $SUI: ML-DSA-65 already running on Devnet. Clear roadmap (testnet end of 2026 → mainnet auth Q1/2027).

@projecteleven: Yellowpages (link BTC → PQC key) + Strongpoint custody. Practical tooling, working with multiple large chains.

@qlabsofficial | $Qone: qVAULT + migration toolkit, uses Falcon. Focused on infra to protect existing assets.

✨ Tier C (Still roadmap, slow ship)

Bitcoin (BIP-360): BIP-360 is in the repo but not live yet. Migration is very hard due to the UTXO model.

Ethereum: Targeting ~2029. Nothing meaningful live yet.
Aptos, Nervos, Solana, XRP Ledger (roadmaps / opt-in): Have proposals, opt-in paths, or roadmaps, but haven’t officially shipped yet.

#DYOR. If I missed anyone actually shipping real PQC, drop them below 👇🏻

